Such children are not required to present documents of any kind.\n\n(2) Aliens who have previously been admitted legally into the United States, have departed therefrom and returned within six months, not having proceeded to countries other than Canada, Newfoundland, St. Pierre, Miquelon, Bermuda, Mexico, Cuba, and other islands included in the Bahama a","path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/texts/cd-opus_zip-5869-3569f61b21.txt","sha256":"0260f5be2346a14d19ef56e9322f12dce481116b2a1ed64713c2f40d7335d584","source":{"line":6,"path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"7aa05c297e418084cc82c88b998fb97d79091f9ccefc816aa57da9bb9566f8fc"}}]}
